  "description": "What the ripe groups of the watcher ask a pass of the daemon to look at, by disk: the names they give, a folder walked below, a name an event said was deleted; or the whole disk, for a group at its root, an overflow, or more names than max_names. A group only Atoll made asks for nothing.",
  "cases": [
